---
config:
  theme: base
  themeCSS: 'text.messageText { paint-order: stroke; stroke: white; stroke-width: 5px; stroke-linejoin: round; }'
  themeVariables:
    fontFamily: "Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif"
    fontSize: "21px"
    primaryColor: "#EDF4FE"
    primaryBorderColor: "#83A0C1"
    primaryTextColor: "#19354D"
    secondaryColor: "#EBF6F1"
    tertiaryColor: "#F5F8FC"
    lineColor: "#55708D"
    edgeLabelBackground: "#FFFFFF"
    clusterBkg: "#F4F8FC"
    clusterBorder: "#B3C8DC"
    actorBkg: "#EDF4FE"
    actorBorder: "#8DAAC8"
    actorTextColor: "#19354D"
    actorLineColor: "#B8CBDE"
    signalColor: "#294E70"
    signalTextColor: "#19354D"
    labelBoxBkgColor: "#EBF6F1"
    labelBoxBorderColor: "#9ABBAE"
    loopTextColor: "#19354D"
    actorFontSize: "20px"
    messageFontSize: "19px"
    sequenceNumberColor: "#FFFFFF"
  flowchart:
    curve: linear
    wrappingWidth: 300
    nodeSpacing: 45
    rankSpacing: 52
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: true
    actorMargin: 60
    messageMargin: 25
    boxMargin: 12
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 学生
    participant B as 业务服务
    participant T as 受控工具
    participant M as 外部模型
    U->>B: 请求修改材料
    B-->>U: 说明外发范围与模型服务
    U->>B: 单独同意本次传输
    B->>T: 传入同意记录及材料版本
    break 发送前未同意或已撤回
        B-->>U: 停止发送
    end
    T->>M: 发送必要内容
    M-->>T: 返回候选改稿
    break 发送后、保存前撤回
        B-->>U: 停止后续传输，丢弃结果
    end
    T->>B: 保存候选稿与差异
    B-->>U: 展示差异，保留原稿
    U->>B: 审阅并请求导出
    alt 通过并确认
        B-->>U: 导出定稿 DOCX
    else 字段待确认
        B-->>U: 导出未定稿副本
    else 导出权限无效
        B-->>U: 停止导出
    end
